<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sonic-shout</ansi> mutation

<ansi fg="white-bold">Sonic Shout</ansi> is an active-ability mutation. Your vocal
cords have mutated into a resonating chamber capable of
unleashing devastating shockwaves of sound.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">sonic-shout</ansi>        Unleash a deafening shout that stuns
                     nearby enemies.

<ansi fg="yellow">Pros:</ansi>
  Grants the <ansi fg="command">sonic-shout</ansi> active ability.

<ansi fg="yellow">Cons:</ansi>
  Permanently reduces Charisma by 15. Your voice is harsh
  and grating — a side effect of the mutation.

<ansi fg="yellow">Visual:</ansi>
  Their throat bulges unnaturally, thick cords of muscle
  visible beneath the skin.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
